# vector-engines-bench
Copyright 2026 tensorhan

This product compares third-party vector search engines. None of that
software is bundled, modified, or redistributed here; it is installed at
runtime at the versions given in requirements.txt and remains under its own
license:

  TurboVec      turbovec[langchain,llama-index]
  FAISS         faiss-cpu
  hnswlib       hnswlib
  LangChain     langchain-core
  LlamaIndex    llama-index-core
  NumPy         numpy

The benchmark downloads the BEIR `scidocs` dataset and embeds it locally with
the `qwen3-embedding:0.6b` model via Ollama. Neither the corpus nor the
resulting vectors are redistributed here; individual BEIR datasets carry
their own terms.

Reported results in result-n25000-d1024-k1000.txt are factual measurements of
the above software and imply no endorsement by its authors.
